text: |-
  Shaffer Security_Group deleted its tweet
  hours later - but its owner, former FBI
  agent Greg Shaffer, reiterated the
  information when reached by phone
  Saturday night.
  alleylopfiles
  "The individuals who work for that
  company [Integrity Security Solutions]
  were the ones on the stage," Shaffer told
  Headline USA.
  Shaffer further said that Integrity Security
  Solutions founder Brian Harpole and
  TPUSA security director Dan Flood both
  used to work with him until they "stabbed
  [him] in the back."
  "Dan Flood headed up security for Turning
  Point USA, and Brian Harpole is his best
  friend. Brian worked for me for seven
  years, and then Brian started his own
